{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The whole of the rider's excess is measured on EV-GPS-04009, and that artifact is not clean. The admissibility pre-pass records it as IMPAIRED with weight_multiplier 0.85 on issue GPS_GAP_SHORT_OR_OUTSIDE_WINDOW — a 70-second run without fixes from 23:16:50 to 23:18:00, whose bounding fixes are 194.6 m apart at the very start of the trip. I disclose that impairment in this claim, as POL-GEN-02(1) requires. Because the deciding fact of this case — the excess distance — is carried by this one artifact and nothing else, POL-GEN-02(2) caps confidence in any finding at 0.85, and the trace is entitled to the discount rather than the benefit of the doubt.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-04009"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-02", "POL-RD-07"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_km",
      "asserted_weight": 0.85
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no second measurement of this journey anywhere in the bundle. EV-FARE-04009 bills 18.96 km — the trace figure to the hundredth of a kilometre — so the ledger carries no distance the trace does not; the trip_record's actual_distance_km of 19.0 is, on the record's own note, the same trace figure rounded to one decimal place; and EV-CHAT-04009 is MISSING at weight 0.0, so it can carry no fact at all. POL-RD-07 warns that a billed distance copied from the trace is not independent corroboration, and here every distance on the file traces back to the one impaired artifact.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-04009", "EV-CHAT-04009", "EV-GPS-04009", "EV-TRIP-04009"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07", "POL-GEN-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.trace_distance_km",
      "asserted_weight": 0.85
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's explanation — that he used the expressway at night because it is faster — is on file in his statement, but it is matched by no record. EV-ADVIS-04009-01, the only traffic advisory identifier in the bundle, is MISSING at weight 0.0, so POL-RD-03's three-part comparison of a named road, a validity window and a corridor that leaves and rejoins the optimal route cannot be run against this case at all. Under POL-RD-13 that unavailability means POL-RD-03 is simply not available, and I do not ask the tribunal to treat an assertion resting on no artifact as an exoneration it cannot be under POL-RD-08. If a deviation is found, it must be found on the trace and on nothing else.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-04009-01", "EV-GPS-04009"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-03", "POL-RD-13", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.advisory_area.advisories"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if a deviation is established, the FULL_REFUND uplift in POL-RD-06(b) is confined to a deviation that is 'both MATERIAL and substantiated on this trip's own evidence'. Here the materiality is reachable only through the same impaired trace, and not one of the independent sources POL-RD-07(ii) names is present: the fare_breakdown repeats the trace's own distance, the chat_log is MISSING so no admission can reside in it, no ERP gantry was charged at all, and the platform holds no independent actual_distance_km. Limb (b) is therefore not engaged on this record, and the remedy, if any, is the POL-RD-02 recomputation against the booked optimal route rather than a full refund of the 27.50 charged.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-04009", "EV-FARE-04009", "EV-DPROF-04009", "EV-CHAT-04009"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-RD-07", "POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.status",
      "asserted_weight": 0.85
    }
  ]
}

